# Workflows the PR release gate may tell an agent to start by hand on a branch (RA-7903).
#
# Pi-Dev-Ops runs workflows only on pull_request and pushes to main (RA-7222), so a branch
# push gives the gate no GitHub run to read before `gh pr create`. These are started with
# `gh workflow run <file> --ref <branch>` instead. List ONLY read-only checks: each one below
# has `permissions: contents: read` and runs a checker, nothing that deploys, posts or writes.
# The first three were dispatched to release #883; living-business-os.yml (RA-8145 M1, #963) runs
# the package conformance check.
fail-open-check.yml
secrets-scan-mutation.yml
skills-drift-check.yml
